NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers the source code in this repository.

It does NOT cover the survey response data in data/. That data is distributed
through the Boston University OpenBU Institutional Repository under the terms
recorded with the deposit, and its reuse is additionally constrained by the
study's IRB protocol (#8256X) and by FERPA. Secondary researchers should
consult the deposit record and contact the study authors before reuse.
